    "name": "Scam Centre Simulator: Under Kingdom",
    "steam_appid": 3484850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/734fc64e375fb70cb335522736198240.avif?t=1754033082\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.poster.avif?t=1754033082\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.webm?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.mp4?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by cleaning streets for spare cash\u2014but that won\u2019t be enough. To get ahead, you\u2019ll need to <strong>lie, steal, gamble, or scam</strong> your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've made your first fortune, <strong>build your scam empire</strong>\u2014set up a scam centre, post fake ads, and trick your victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/c5be583b359f9987e8ee831f841a21e2.poster.avif?t=1754033082\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/c5be583b359f9987e8ee831f841a21e2.webm?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/c5be583b359f9987e8ee831f841a21e2.mp4?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your workers</strong> and decide: treat them fairly, or squeeze them for every dollar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this town, only the cunning survive.<br><strong>Will you rise\u2014or fall under your own schemes?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/734fc64e375fb70cb335522736198240.avif?t=1754033082\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.poster.avif?t=1754033082\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.webm?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/a5d4a7547d35a14ca4c3d3f3bd039b36.mp4?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by cleaning streets for spare cash\u2014but that won\u2019t be enough. To get ahead, you\u2019ll need to <strong>lie, steal, gamble, or scam</strong> your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've made your first fortune, <strong>build your scam empire</strong>\u2014set up a scam centre, post fake ads, and trick your victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/c5be583b359f9987e8ee831f841a21e2.poster.avif?t=1754033082\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/c5be583b359f9987e8ee831f841a21e2.webm?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/c5be583b359f9987e8ee831f841a21e2.mp4?t=1754033082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your workers</strong> and decide: treat them fairly, or squeeze them for every dollar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this town, only the cunning survive.<br><strong>Will you rise\u2014or fall under your own schemes?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Run your own scam operation and pay off your debt. Expand your business by recruiting workers through shady means. Bribe the police, trade with others, and use every strategy to survive in this city. Will you rise to power or fall under the pressure? The choice is yours.",
